##### Objective Function

\[
\min \sum_{i \in I} \sum_{j \in J} c_{ij} x_{ij}
\]

##### Constraints

1. **Demand satisfaction:** For each customer group $j \in J$,
   \[
   \sum_{i \in I} x_{ij} \geq d_j
   \]
   That is,
   \[
   \begin{align*}
   \sum_{i \in I} x_{i,C1} &\geq 11 \\
   \sum_{i \in I} x_{i,C2} &\geq 1148 \\
   \sum_{i \in I} x_{i,C3} &\geq 54 \\
   \sum_{i \in I} x_{i,C4} &\geq 833 \\
   \sum_{i \in I} x_{i,C5} &\geq 154 \\
   \sum_{i \in I} x_{i,C6} &\geq 551 \\
   \sum_{i \in I} x_{i,C7} &\geq 7081 \\
   \sum_{i \in I} x_{i,C8} &\geq 76 \\
   \sum_{i \in I} x_{i,C9} &\geq 66 \\
   \sum_{i \in I} x_{i,C10} &\geq 174 \\
   \sum_{i \in I} x_{i,C11} &\geq 15 \\
   \sum_{i \in I} x_{i,C12} &\geq 680 \\
   \end{align*}
   \]

2. **Supply capacity:** For each store $i \in I$,
   \[
   \sum_{j \in J} x_{ij} \leq s_i
   \]
   That is,
   \[
   \begin{align*}
   \sum_{j \in J} x_{S1,j} &\leq 4 \\
   \sum_{j \in J} x_{S2,j} &\leq 575 \\
   \sum_{j \in J} x_{S3,j} &\leq 1504 \\
   \sum_{j \in J} x_{S4,j} &\leq 178 \\
   \sum_{j \in J} x_{S5,j} &\leq 228 \\
   \sum_{j \in J} x_{S6,j} &\leq 50 \\
   \sum_{j \in J} x_{S7,j} &\leq 3 \\
   \sum_{j \in J} x_{S8,j} &\leq 6148 \\
   \sum_{j \in J} x_{S9,j} &\leq 6 \\
   \sum_{j \in J} x_{S10,j} &\leq 10673 \\
   \sum_{j \in J} x_{S11,j} &\leq 174 \\
   \end{align*}
   \]

3. **Non-negativity:** For all $i \in I$, $j \in J$,
   \[
   x_{ij} \geq 0
   \]

##### Complete Model

\[
\begin{align*}
\min\ & \sum_{i \in I} \sum_{j \in J} c_{ij} x_{ij} \\
\text{s.t.}\quad
& \sum_{i \in I} x_{ij} \geq d_j \quad \forall j \in J \\
& \sum_{j \in J} x_{ij} \leq s_i \quad \forall i \in I \\
& x_{ij} \geq 0 \quad \forall i \in I,\, j \in J \\
\end{align*}
\]

